    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 495.62,
      "end": 498.77,
      "text": "然后你不写场景。"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 498.77,
      "end": 500.77,
      "text": "你怎么做的,设计的场景。"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 500.77,
      "end": 502.77,
      "text": "你怎么去使场景得以实现。"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 502.77,
      "end": 503.77,
      "text": "你不写。"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 503.77,
